    default (both TeX) exit 1 as expected ; SHA256SUMS_ja 13/13 OK
  - compute_all_figures -> generate_figures: paper_data.json differs from the shipped SSOT only in _meta.generated_at /
    _meta.git_commit ; all 6 PNG figures byte-identical ; lualatex 30 pages / undefined 0 / overfull 8 (TikZ).
  - 8 deterministic entry points exit 0 ; SHA-256 before/after over 1527 files: only scoring_audit.json and
